      <title>利率上升威胁股价与资产 “Bondmageddon”或重置全球市场</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%87%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%B7%E4%B8%8E%E8%B5%84%E4%BA%A7-Bondmageddon%E6%88%96%E9%87%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA/</link>
